# What the Claude job needs for the session claude-test.md describes.
# backend: yes when the prompt uses the test backend; a run that asks for Claude must then start it too.
# max-turns and max-budget-usd (optional) bound the session; claude-test.sh uses 60 and 3 when they're absent.
# Shared by desktop and Android (both run desktop-linux/claude-test.sh): B02-2 needs about 130 (desktop) and 125 (Android) turns.
backend: no
max-turns: 600
max-budget-usd: 5
